{title: Evermore}
{x_theme: praise, worship, name-of-jesus, victory}
{x_source: docx:1. Incomplete/Evermore.docx}

{comment: Chorus}
Evermore, I will love You
Evermore, I will serve You
Evermore, I will glorify the name of the Lord
Evermore, I’ll adore You
Evermore bow before You
I will bless Your name for evermore

{comment: Verse 1}
You alone I glorify,
And of Your goodness testify
Your banner I will lift on high
For ever and ever
When my life on earth is done
When my battles have been won
I’ll sing my praise around the throne
For ever and ever
